{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07594","headline":"仰荅韦司业垂访五首 二 · 萧颖士","name":"仰荅韦司业垂访五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神龟在南国，缅邈湘川阴。\n游止莲叶上，岁时嘉树林。\n毒虫且不近，斤斧何由寻。\n错落负奇文，荧煌耀丹金。\n江山万里余，淮海阻且深。\n独保贞素质，不爲寒暑侵。\n一逢盛明代，应见通灵心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}